Deadtime Stories - independent runtime rewrite
Version @PROJECT_VERSION@ (development build)

Start deadtime.exe directly. Game data is in data/ beside the executable.
Profiles, progress and settings use the system user-data directory and are
preserved by the uninstaller. F11 switches fullscreen/windowed mode.

Original game content and Chinese translation retain their respective rights.
